PLUMED-JAX

plumed-jax is an AI-assisted adaptation of selected PLUMED functionality
for JAX-based simulations. It builds on the scientific methods and
implementation work of PLUMED's developers and contributors.

PLUMED: https://www.plumed.org/

If you use or build upon plumed-jax, please acknowledge PLUMED's developers
and contributors, and cite the original PLUMED papers and the methods you
use. See https://www.plumed.org/cite.

